id: pm-linear-toolchain-1104
title: Migrate PR206 to the November 4 pm toolchain
description: "Update exact development pins and migrate typed parent clearing for PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/206 and issue #207. Existing dated certification and literal-provider-value items cover different acceptance scopes."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
