acceptance_criteria: Typed parent clearing preserves forward and shared create-plan ambient-scope isolation; focused and full coverage gates pass without weaker assertions; record remaining upstream defects.
comments[28]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-04T18:56:36.674Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Production: pm-cli 2026.10.30 GH-1614 keeps typed sentinel values literal; forward create and shared atomic create-plan emitted parent:none and are refused on 2026.11.4. Replace with unset:[parent,goal,objective,sprint,release]. Test: fixture and reference-model parent:none controls have the same old-contract dependency; migrate explicit clears without removing assertions. npm registry confirms CLI/ops 2026.11.4 and changelog 2026.10.31."
  "2026-11-04T18:57:26.958Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"New test/typed-parent-clear.test.ts passes 2/2 on 2026.11.4; reverting only index.ts to the PR source fails both tests, then restoring the fix passes. It exercises forward creation and the shared create-plan options via real SDK persistence under ambient parent/scope focus. Before migration: forward-import 0/6, ownership 3/29, literal-values 0/6. Retain the conservative provider-value guard for the older declared minimum; update its stale documentation instead of broadening scope."
  "2026-11-04T18:59:30.455Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Secondary CLI pin: update test/estimate-packed-acceptance.ts default host from 2026.10.28 to 2026.11.4. Historical validation artifacts retain their measured versions; manifest/peer minimum remains >=2026.10.24. No tracked dist files or lint script. Typecheck, build:test, docstring, production audit (0 vulnerabilities), pack dry-run, release-date and publish-attestation checks pass. Strict tracked health exits 0 with an inherited provenance advisory; no history repair attempted."
  "2026-11-04T19:40:25.097Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"The packed estimate acceptance default now derives its host version from package.json rather than duplicating a calendar version; the existing explicit host-version override remains available. On this PR it resolves 2026.11.4, so future dependency bumps do not silently retain an older default."
  "2026-11-04T20:09:36.150Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Local budget reached after approximately 75 minutes. Stopped nice -n 10 env NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null npm run coverage while the 500-sequence forward failure/retry model was still active. Completed tests had no assertion failures, including the real 10002-item complete-corpus case, 500 dependency-graph sequences and 500 import/export/sync sequences. Cancellation reports for unfinished files are budget-stop effects, not SDK regressions. Full-suite pass counts and aggregate coverage are unmeasured; CI must finish the unchanged 99/96/100 gate and Node22/26/npm/Bun release acceptance. The targeted new regression passed 2/2 and failed both cases when only the production fix was reverted. No new upstream defect established."
  "2026-11-04T20:10:18.935Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Interrupted-run summary: 166 passed, 0 failed, 20 cancelled. These are partial Node runner counts, including cancelled file placeholders, not a complete test inventory or a coverage pass."
  "2026-11-04T23:26:31.042Z",codex-agent,"Review round: PR206 has zero review threads and zero CodeRabbit reviews. Fetched the PR head; it includes origin/main. Work continues on fix/linear-toolchain-2026-11-4 to avoid Dependabot auto-merge. Investigating dependency-start admission in the seeded ownership model; retain all 500 sequences and assertions, add behavioral revert evidence, finish serial nice npm/Bun release gates."
  "2026-11-04T23:29:03.364Z",codex-agent,"Root cause: pm-cli CHANGELOG 2026.11.4, pm-urzubi (Starting work ignores open blockers), introduces strict start_blocked_by_open_dependency admission. Classification: ownership model contract migration, not an SDK defect or a production need to start blocked work. Live imports already catch the native refusal as import_conflict; only owned-copy ownership projection explicitly forces writes. The model now predicts refused starts, asserts unchanged native state, cycles blocker completion to retain admitted starts, and retains all 500 sequences and field/relationship assertions. New live-import regression passes 1/1 across default and deprecated atomic opt-in routes, then succeeds after blocker completion."
  "2026-11-04T23:32:39.913Z",codex-agent,"Fresh evidence: original CI run 41904097774 fails the seeded ownership model with start_blocked_by_open_dependency in npm, Bun, Node22 and Node26. Disposable parent-clear behavioral revert (only index.ts restored from origin/main) fails both typed-parent-clear tests (0 passed, 2 failed); restored production passes 2/2. Pinned pm test --run --progress --match 'start admission' passes 1/1 (no evidence tracking enabled; recording results here). Strict health passes with one inherited provenance advisory; no history repair. Full diff self-review found no remaining typed parent:none writes and no live import force bypass."
  "2026-11-04T23:36:36.488Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: in a disposable copy, replace only applyNativeChange's admission-aware body with the previous unconditional pm.update call, retaining the new blocker cycles and every assertion. The unchanged seeded test fails 0/1 after 66 completed comparisons with start_blocked_by_open_dependency. The source worktree was never reverted. Fixed focused model continues; full npm release gate started on Node26 under nice with isolated home/git config, credential-free npm config, one test worker and unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-11-05T00:23:42.310Z",codex-agent,"Fixed focused ownership model completes all 500 sequences on Node24: 1/1 passed, 0 failed, 0 cancelled, 16 predicted refused starts and 9 admitted starts. Every historical replay, field hash, export, count and source-preservation assertion remains exercised. This completes the restored passing side of the behavioral revert proof (unconditional update fails after 66 comparisons). Code and initial tracker evidence are committed together in 4d988a4 on the replacement branch; identity check contains only the required SteveBot address. Full npm release gate continues on Node26 with 102 passing cases and no reported assertion failures so far; this is progress, not a gate pass."
  "2026-11-05T00:29:25.024Z",codex-agent,"Additional negative control: in a disposable copy, forcing all live existing-item updates (rather than only owned-copy projections) makes the new start-admission regression fail 0/1. The fixed live path then passes 1/1 on Node26. This verifies that live imports retain the SDK refusal rather than relying on blocked starts. No production bypass is needed."
  "2026-11-05T02:28:38.794Z",codex-agent,"Full nice npm release:check completed on Node26 with isolated home/global Git configuration and credential-free npm configuration: exit 0; 460 tests passed, 0 failed, 0 cancelled, 0 skipped. Coverage: 99.64% lines, 96.99% branches, 100% functions; unchanged thresholds 99/96/100 and complete required source presence (1 shipped source file). The ownership model completed all 500 sequences with 16 refused starts and 9 admitted starts under coverage. Typecheck, build, docstring, production audit, package dry-run, changelog check, release-date check and publish-attestation check all passed. No local timeout or retry was needed. Dist rebuilt; this repository tracks no dist files. Starting the full Bun release gate serially under nice."
  "2026-11-05T04:40:32.150Z",codex-agent,"Full nice Bun release:check completed on Node26: exit 0; 460 tests passed, 0 failed, 0 cancelled, 0 skipped. Coverage matches npm: 99.64% lines, 96.99% branches, 100% functions; unchanged 99/96/100 thresholds and complete required source presence. All 500 ownership sequences pass with 16 refused and 9 admitted starts. Both complete release gates passed without local timeouts or retries, including every build/static/audit/package/changelog/publish-policy step. Fresh PR206 query still has zero threads and no CodeRabbit review body; its head remains 5d43bf385a196f9fc844b9fc68af58d259ab029e. Refetched main: branch is ahead, not behind. Publishing only the replacement fix branch and a superseding PR; original Dependabot branch stays untouched."
  "2026-11-05T04:43:42.265Z",codex-agent,"Published replacement PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/208, superseding PR206, with root cause, classification, real tracker-folder link, behavioral proofs and both complete 460/460 release gates. Posted exactly one original-PR comment: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/206#issuecomment-6649882136. PR206 remains open at 5d43bf385a196f9fc844b9fc68af58d259ab029e; no Dependabot-branch push occurred. New PR has no auto-merge request. First pushed-head CI is queued: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/actions/runs/41969406109 (head 811e1198f3d365f88ae157da1f166ace28813818); CodeQL is queued at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/actions/runs/41969406244. These are pending evidence, not approval. Final tracker handoff will trigger fresh exact-head CI; follow https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/208/checks for the latest head. Releasing only this agent's claim for orchestrator verification; item remains in_progress. No CLI/SDK defect or UX gap was established in this round."
  "2026-11-05T07:04:07.101Z",codex-agent,"Review round PR208 at 8003b2a: fetched all review threads and every comment (one unresolved PRRT_kwDOSYpKlc6z7hMD; no pagination remaining) and latest CodeRabbit review (no Outside diff range findings). Branch includes current main. Confirmed typed-parent-clear only imports the dev SDK, while the declared peer/manifest minimum is 2026.10.24. Add credential-free isolated consumers for minimum and dev pins to the normal test/coverage glob; exercise both forward and shared-plan creates with ambient focus and all absent-relationship assertions. Prove each route fails with only its production clearing reverted in a disposable copy, then rerun passing consumers and full serial npm/Bun release gates."
  "2026-11-05T07:10:19.823Z",codex-agent,"Focused pinned pm test --run --progress --only-last passes 4/4 outer tests on the new matrix, including 2/2 forward/shared-plan consumers on each installed SDK (2026.10.24 minimum and 2026.11.4 dev pin). Real non-git trackers verify persisted parent/goal/objective/sprint/release/assignee absence. The consumer checks the installed SDK version and inherits no credentials. Self-review found SDK GH-1577 changed focus inheritance in 2026.10.26: older hosts inherit implicitly; newer shared-plan consumers opt in explicitly. Added a positive inheritance control and replaced the old unset-array shape assertion with behavioral persistence checks. Initial harness failures exposed that compatibility boundary and the Node26 default reporter; corrected both before validation. The full PR diff has only two production clearing sites, both covered, with no remaining typed parent:none writes. No additional production defect found."
  "2026-11-05T07:12:29.836Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proofs complete in a disposable copy; rebuilt dist after each production-source change, never mutated the reviewed implementation. (1) Restore index.ts from main (the original parent:none implementation at the two changed create sites): matrix exits 1; SDK 2026.11.4 forward/shared-plan fail 0/2 while SDK 2026.10.24 correctly accepts the older sentinel contract 2/2. Outer tests: 1 passed, 3 failed. (2) Remove only parent from unset at both production create sites (no test changes): SDK 2026.10.24 fails both routes with forward/parent and shared-plan/parent inherited-anchor readback; SDK 2026.11.4 fails shared-plan/parent with explicit focus opt-in. Outer tests: 1 passed, 3 failed. (3) Restore fixed source and rebuild: matrix passes 4/4 outer tests, with 2/2 consumer routes on each SDK. Positive ambient-parent controls and persisted field assertions prevent an inert fixture from passing. Focused typecheck/build:test and docstring gate pass. Strict health exits 0 with the inherited historical-provenance advisory; no history rewrite performed. Starting full serial npm and Bun release gates with isolated home/git configuration, Node26, credential-free child environments, one test worker and unchanged 99/96/100 thresholds."
  "2026-11-05T08:38:17.766Z",codex-agent,"Full npm release:check passed first attempt on Node26 with isolated home/global git configuration and credential-free npm configuration: exit 0; 462 tests passed, 0 failed/cancelled/skipped; 99.64% lines, 96.94% branches, 100% functions, unchanged 99/96/100 thresholds and required source presence (one shipped source). Both installed-SDK consumers pass 2/2 routes inside the full gate. All 500-sequence graph, estimate/import, forward failure/retry and ownership models pass. Typecheck, build, build:test, docstrings, production audit (0 vulnerabilities), package dry-run, changelog, release-date and publish-attestation checks pass. Elapsed approximately 84 minutes under nice with one test worker; no timeout or retry. Dist rebuilt; no dist files are tracked. Full Bun release gate has started serially."
  "2026-11-05T10:09:22.079Z",codex-agent,"Full Bun release:check passed first attempt on Node26 with isolated home/global git configuration and credential-free npm configuration: exit 0; 462 passed, 0 failed/cancelled/skipped; 99.64% lines, 96.94% branches, 100% functions. Unchanged 99/96/100 thresholds and required source presence (one shipped source) pass. Both installed SDK consumers pass forward/shared-plan 2/2 on minimum 2026.10.24 and dev pin 2026.11.4. All 500 ownership sequences complete with 16 refused and 9 admitted starts. Every build/static/audit/package/changelog/release-date/publish-attestation step passes; elapsed approximately 91 minutes with one test worker, no timeout or retry. npm and Bun are now both fully green. Fresh review fetch still has only PRRT_kwDOSYpKlc6z7hMD with its single comment and no Outside diff range findings; remote main and PR head remain unchanged. Whole-PR self-review found no other instance and no new CLI/SDK defect or UX gap. Both behavioral revert proofs are recorded above. Final handoff commits the shared built-artifact consumer fixture, normal-suite minimum/dev host matrix, docs and append-only tracker evidence together. Releasing only this agent claim; do not close the item. Final push triggers fresh exact-head CI: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/208/checks (pending evidence, not approval). No thread replies/resolutions, merge or release performed."
  "2026-11-05T10:13:29.327Z",codex-agent,"Published review fix commit 45d6253fb335421824c0123a0f58a6a25cd7af8e with code/docs and matching tracker history; remote head verified and worktree clean. PR description updated through REST because gh pr edit hit the Projects Classic deprecation; exact published-body readback and privacy checks pass. First pushed-head CI is running: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/actions/runs/42008538627 (test Node22/26 and release-gate npm/Bun pending). CodeQL passed: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/actions/runs/42008538537. CodeRabbit and Sourcery checks are skipped and cubic is neutral; these are missing review evidence, not approval. Both local full release gates remain 462/462 with unchanged thresholds and recorded revert proofs. This final receipt commit changes only PM evidence and triggers fresh final-head CI; latest exact-head results remain pending at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/208/checks and must be verified by the orchestrator. Item remains in_progress with this agent claim already released. No thread responses/resolutions, merge, release, or new PM CLI/SDK defect."
  "2026-11-05T11:14:39.504Z",codex-agent,"PR208 review round at 7300439: fetched all three threads with every comment; both unresolved findings are valid (PRRT_kwDOSYpKlc60CIC5 Windows npm.cmd without shell, PRRT_kwDOSYpKlc60CICw recorded parent-clear commands omit build). No thread/comment pagination remains and the latest CodeRabbit review has no Outside diff range findings. Remote branch is current and includes origin/main. No reusable command-spawn helper exists; add a narrow validated SDK-install command builder with fully quoted Windows shell tokens and direct POSIX argv, command-construction regressions and disposable behavioral revert proofs. Update both linked commands through pinned pm, retain append-only history, then run focused tests and full serial npm/Bun release gates at unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-11-05T11:20:43.797Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral review proofs: nice -n 10 node test/revert-toolchain-review.ts uses disposable non-git copies and leaves the reviewed checkout unchanged. Restoring only direct Windows npm.cmd spawning fails the unchanged regression (3 passed, 1 failed). Removing only Windows shell token quoting also fails 3/1. Removing the build prefix independently from either recorded parent-clear command fails 3/1 for each. Restoring all fixed inputs passes 4/4, zero failures. The consumer uses node:os.devNull for cross-platform null npm configuration. Original history remains untouched; linked command identities were replaced using pinned pm remove/add writes with fresh provenance. Full-PR diff inspection found no other newly introduced npm command launch and both production clear sites remain covered by the installed-SDK matrix. No new production or SDK defect was established."
