  "2026-11-05T12:49:30.237Z",codex-agent,"Published code and matching PM evidence together in 0368230e38557254bb8ff3af1f6d27610316c267. Remote head readback matches; worktree was clean after push and every PR commit email matches the required SteveBot identity. Final-head CI is queued at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/actions/runs/42030291467 and CodeQL at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/actions/runs/42030291361. Full npm and Bun gates are pending, not approval. Local serial npm remains active with no reported failed tests; no concurrent local Bun suite. CI polling cutoff is 30 minutes after this push. No thread replies/resolutions, merge, release, or auto-merge request."
